ryTest`, which can cause other tests to fail when the order of test execution is changed.\r\n\r\nSuch failures could be provoked by these commands:\r\n```sh\r\nmvn clean test -Dtest=RuntimeExceptionDaoTest#testCallBatchTasksThrow,LoggerFactoryTest#testSetLogFactory\r\nmvn clean test -Dtest=RuntimeExceptionDaoTest#testCallBatchTasksThrow,LoggerFactoryTest#testLogFactoryAsClass\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR intends to fix these order dependencies by resetting the `LogBackend` after each test. ", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2025-02-20T15:31:47Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-21T15:24:04Z", "closed_at": "2025-02-21T14:46:56Z", "merged_at": "2025-02-21T14:46:56Z", "merge_commit_sha": "c80bde196ca152ecc8a3c4f38f77dbe5a4ea3232", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "12rcu:fix-logger-od-flaky-test", "ref": "fix-logger-od-flaky-test", "repo": {"id": 936125065, "node_id": "R_kgDON8wiiQ", "name": "ormlite-core", "full_name": "12rcu/ormlite-core", "owner": {"login": "12rcu", "id": 56599453, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU2NTk5NDUz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56599453?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/12rcu", "html_url": "https://github.com/12rcu", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/12rcu/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/12rcu/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/12rcu/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/12rcu/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/12rcu/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/12rcu/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/12rcu/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/12rcu/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/12rcu/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "priv